exports[`buildDrawingSetOp > builds a partial set for review: keeps the FIG label, marks the receipt INCOMPLETE SET and leaves the Filing Manifest 1`] = `
{
  "figLabels": [
    "FIG. 2",
  ],
  "manifest": "manifest of the export",
  "receiptRows": [
    "| figures-missing | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i) (every Figure the description names is in the Drawing Set) | fail | FIG. 1, 3–5 not drawn |",
    "| single-figure-no-label | 37 CFR 1.84(u)(1); GL A-IX 5.2; PCT IP 5.141 (a single Figure is not numbered and carries no "FIG.") | not-checked | 5 Figures; the rule applies to one. |",
    "| figure-labels | 37 CFR 1.84(u)(1); GL A-IX 5.2; PCT Rule 11.13(k), IP 5.141 ("FIG." / "Fig.", consecutive Arabic numerals, partial views as number plus capital letter) | pass | FIG. 2. |",
  ],
  "receiptStart": [
    "INCOMPLETE SET: FIG. 1, 3–5 not drawn",
    "",
    "This partial build is for review only. It is not a Drawing Set to file, and the Filing Manifest was not changed.",
  ],
  "result": {
    "manifestUpdated": false,
    "missing": [
      "1",
      "3",
      "4",
      "5",
    ],
    "text": [
      "INCOMPLETE SET: FIG. 1, 3–5 not drawn. Built for review only (partial); do not present it as the Drawing Set.",
      "Built a partial set for review of 1 Figure(s) on 1 letter sheet(s) for US: drafting/hinge/drawings/sheet-1.svg, drafting/hinge/drawings/drawings.pdf, and the receipt drafting/hinge/drawings/drawings-compliance.md. Review renders of the sheets are in drafting/hinge/drawings/review/.",
    ],
  },
  "stillToDraw": "Still to draw: FIG. 1, 3–5 (drafting/hinge/figures.md names 5 Figure(s)); build_drawing_set refuses until every one is drawn.",
}
`;

exports[`buildDrawingSetOp > lays out the Figures, writes the sheets, the PDF and the receipt, and updates the Filing Manifest 1`] = `
{
  "drawings": [
    "FIG-1.scene.json",
    "FIG-1.svg",
    "FIG-2.scene.json",
    "FIG-2.svg",
    "drawings-compliance.md",
    "drawings.pdf",
    "rounds.json",
    "sheet-1.svg",
    "sheet-2.svg",
  ],
  "manifestSheets": [
    "| Drawing sheets | 2 (measured: the sheet-N.svg files in drawings/) |",
    "| Drawings | drawings/ (Drawing Sheets) | 2 |",
  ],
  "pdfHeader": "%PDF-1.4",
  "receipt": "# Drawing Set check receipt

- Office: US
- Page size: letter
- Drawing Sheets: 2
- Date: <date>
- Results: 29 pass, 0 fail, 1 not checked

This file lists each code check, the rule it applies and its result. It is not a verdict on the drawings. The rules a person must judge (sufficient views, every claimed feature shown, suitable legends) are not checked here; the attorney reviews them.

## Checks

| Check | Rule | Result | Detail |
|---|---|---|---|
| figures-missing | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i) (every Figure the description names is in the Drawing Set) | pass | All 2 Figure(s) of the figure list are drawn. |
| page-size | 37 CFR 1.84(f); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 2(2); PCT Rule 11.5 (A4 for all, Letter for the USPTO only; one size per application) | pass | 2 sheet(s), all letter 215.9 x 279.4 mm, short side at the top. |
| margins | 37 CFR 1.84(g), (t); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(1), Art. 2(5); PCT Rule 11.6(c), 11.7 (top 25, left 25, right 15, bottom 10 mm; nothing in the margin) | pass | Every Figure, label and sheet number is inside the 175.90 x 244.40 mm sight. |
| no-frame | 37 CFR 1.84(g); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(1); PCT Rule 11.6(c) (no frame around the sight) | pass | No frame and no drawn element outside the Figures. |
| glyph-height | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(3); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(g); PCT Rule 11.13(h) (0.32 cm minimum at sheet scale) | pass | Smallest glyph at sheet scale: 3.22 mm (minimum 3.2 mm). |
| label-larger-than-numerals | 37 CFR 1.84(t), (u)(2); GL A-IX 4.2, 5.2 (FIG labels and sheet numbers larger than the reference signs) | pass | Labels and sheet numbers at least 6.00 mm; numerals up to 4.50 mm. |
| single-figure-no-label | 37 CFR 1.84(u)(1); GL A-IX 5.2; PCT IP 5.141 (a single Figure is not numbered and carries no "FIG.") | not-checked | 2 Figures; the rule applies to one. |
| figure-labels | 37 CFR 1.84(u)(1); GL A-IX 5.2; PCT Rule 11.13(k), IP 5.141 ("FIG." / "Fig.", consecutive Arabic numerals, partial views as number plus capital letter) | pass | FIG. 1, FIG. 2. |
| sheet-numbering | 37 CFR 1.84(t); PCT AI Section 207(b)(iii), Rule 11.7 ("n/N"); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 2(5), GL A-IX 4.2 (consecutive integer); centred at the top of the sight | pass | "n/N" 1 to 2, centred at the top of the sight. |
| orientation | 37 CFR 1.84(i) (top of a sideways sheet on the right); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(h); PCT Rule 11.13(j) (top of the Figures on the left) | pass | 2 upright sheet(s), 0 sideways with the Figure top on the right. |
| text-keywords | 37 CFR 1.84(o); MPEP 507(C); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(j); PCT Rule 11.11 (a few short keywords; flowcharts and block diagrams excepted) | pass | No Figure has more than 3 words of legend text (flowcharts and block diagrams excepted). |
| no-scale-text | 37 CFR 1.84(k); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(c); PCT Rule 11.13(d) (no "actual size" or "scale 1:2") | pass | No scale or "actual size" text. |
| pdf-format | USPTO Patent Center PDF Guidelines; PCT Annex F 3.1.2 (PDF 1.4 to 1.6, fonts embedded, unencrypted, one page per sheet, A4 or Letter) | pass | PDF 1.4, 2 page(s), fonts embedded, not encrypted. |
| part-without-numeral | CONTEXT.md Figure ("every part drawn has one"); 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i) | pass | No finding. |
| numeral-without-port | 37 CFR 1.84(q) ("extend to the feature indicated"); GL A-IX 7.5.1 | pass | No finding. |
| numeral-not-allowed | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i); PCT Rule 11.13(l) | pass | No finding. |
| numeral-two-parts | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(4); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i); PCT Rule 11.13(m) | pass | No finding. |
| lead-lines-cross | 37 CFR 1.84(q) ("Lead lines must not cross each other") | pass | No finding. |
| lead-line-off-part | 37 CFR 1.84(q) ("extend to the feature indicated"); GL A-IX 7.5.1 | pass | No finding. |
| lead-line-far-from-numeral | 37 CFR 1.84(q) ("originate in the immediate proximity of the reference character") | pass | No finding. |
| lead-line-missing | 37 CFR 1.84(q) (lead line required unless the numeral is underlined); PCT IP 5.145 | pass | No finding. |
| glyph-too-small | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(3); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(g); PCT Rule 11.13(h) (0.32 cm minimum) | pass | No finding. |
| text-beyond-keywords | 37 CFR 1.84(o); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(j) ("a few short keywords"); PCT Rule 11.11; 37 CFR 1.84(k) (no scale text) | pass | No finding. |
| numeral-overlap | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(3) ("should not cross or mingle with the lines") | pass | No finding. |
| numeral-on-line | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(3) ("should not cross or mingle with the lines", not on hatched surfaces); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(b) | pass | No finding. |
| hatch-same-as-neighbour | 37 CFR 1.84(h)(3) ("regularly spaced oblique parallel lines"; juxtaposed parts hatched differently); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(b); PCT Rule 11.13(b) | pass | No finding. |
| lead-ends-on-nothing | 37 CFR 1.84(q) (lead lines "must originate in the immediate proximity of the reference character and extend to the feature indicated"); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 2 | pass | No finding. |
| lead-along-edge | 37 CFR 1.84(q) (lead lines "as short as possible", must not cross each other; a lead along an edge reads as the edge); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 2 | pass | No finding. |
| lead-crosses-outline | 37 CFR 1.84(q) (lead lines "as short as possible"); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 2 | pass | No finding. |
| figure-parts-not-drawn | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i) (reference signs not in the description are not in the drawings, and the reverse) | pass | No finding. |

## Review rounds

| Figure | Rounds the model saw | Latest render |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | cycle 1, round 1 | review/FIG-1.round-1.png |
| 2 | cycle 1, no render seen | - |
",
  "result": {
    "manifestUpdated": true,
    "pageSize": "letter",
    "sheets": 2,
    "text": "Built the Drawing Set of 2 Figure(s) on 2 letter sheet(s) for US: drafting/hinge/drawings/sheet-1.svg, drafting/hinge/drawings/sheet-2.svg, drafting/hinge/drawings/drawings.pdf, and the receipt drafting/hinge/drawings/drawings-compliance.md. Review renders of the sheets are in drafting/hinge/drawings/review/.
Receipt: 29 pass, 0 fail, 1 not checked.
No code check fails.
Updated drafting/hinge/filing-manifest.md: 2 drawing sheet(s), measured.
Report the receipt by check. The rules a person must judge (sufficient views, every claimed feature shown) stay with the attorney; never call the drawings compliant or ready to file.",
  },
  "review": [
    "FIG-1.round-1.png",
    "FIG-2.round-1.png",
    "sheet-1.png",
    "sheet-2.png",
  ],
}
`;

exports[`buildDrawingSetOp > refuses on an open Figure Error and builds once findings.md waives it 1`] = `
{
  "built": true,
  "receiptRow": "| numeral-not-allowed | 37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i); PCT Rule 11.13(l) | pass | Waived: The top face is named in the description only. |",
  "refused": {
    "ok": false,
    "reason": "1 Error(s) of the Figures are open. Fix each in the Figure source and render again, or the attorney waives it: copy the item under "## Errors" in drafting/hinge/findings.md and add a line \`  - Waived: <reason>\` under it.
- \`numeral-not-allowed\` (FIG-1.scene.json): Numeral 12 is not in the figures list (allowed: 10).",
  },
}
`;

exports[`buildDrawingSetOp > refuses with no Figure, on a proposed part, on a figure-list Error and on a coverage gap 1`] = `
{
  "coverageGap": {
    "ok": false,
    "reason": "1 Error(s) of the figure list are open; fix each in drafting/hinge/figures.md, or the attorney waives it in drafting/hinge/findings.md:
- \`figure-coverage\` (figures.md, claim 1): Feature List row F1, which the Draft Outline cites for claim 1, has no drawn part in figures.md (37 CFR 1.83(a): the drawings must show every feature specified in the claims). The attorney decides: "Add a figure of a housing 10 with a top face 12 (F1)", then link its part under the figure heading, e.g. "- 20: <part> [F1]"; or "Remove claim 1 (this re-opens the claims approval)".",
  },
  "epoLetter": {
    "ok": false,
    "reason": "1 Error(s) of the figure list are open; fix each in drafting/hinge/figures.md, or the attorney waives it in drafting/hinge/findings.md:
- \`page-size-mismatch\` (figures.md): figures.md sets \`pageSize: letter\`, but the EPO export puts the text on A4 (Rule 49 EPC page setup). One page size per application (OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(1)(a); PCT Rule 11.5). The EPO accepts A4 sheets only. Set \`pageSize: A4\`, or remove the line to use the office default.",
  },
  "noFigure": {
    "ok": false,
    "reason": "drafting/hinge/drawings/ has no Figure (FIG-N.svg). Render each Figure with render_figure first.",
  },
  "proposed": {
    "ok": false,
    "reason": "drafting/hinge/figures.md has 1 proposed part(s); the attorney confirms each by removing "(proposed)", or deletes the line:
- \`figure-proposal\` (figures.md, line 14): Part 8 ("spring") is a proposal from sketches/sketch-1.png: the disclosure does not state it. The attorney confirms it by removing "(proposed)", or deletes the line.",
  },
}
`;

